# Fixes what graphify indexes, so a rebuild anywhere -- a contributor's
# checkout, a fresh clone, the weekly workflow -- produces the same graph.
# `graphify update` has no --code-only flag and the scope `extract` used lives
# in an untracked cache, so without this file a fresh clone indexes more.

# YAML is pure mapping keys, not structure: 286 nodes here, mostly CI workflows.
*.yml
*.yaml

# Prose. 456 nodes from docs/ and the root Markdown files.
*.md

# Generated from docs/tutorials/*.md by the tutorial-ipynb hook, so indexing
# them would double-count every tutorial.
*.ipynb

*.svg
*.png
